    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad9bd2ec2eee573c051ea08d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若想靠原本的跑法获胜，\n就必须进行比之前更严苛的训练，\n但那样会提升受伤的风险。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744adae9d10db3013d3bbdd725192ccbc04e8ec53bcc97729c4ff71427351a73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
