    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3319259ebb81727f98b8a468",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "苦涩糖衣对此感到困惑，但想获胜的念头，\n以及㭴本训练员想让她获胜的心意，\n还是让苦涩糖衣下定决心改变跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2cee4291c7ccfb18455c8dd55ceb6412a2e57adbc716b09dd3b7a93bbaa0b28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0005/storytimeline_400005416.json",
      "json_path": [
