    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d01222525cdb37e3e45b56c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了学会和以前不同的跑法，\n苦涩糖衣开始进行新训练。\n然而，情况一直很不顺利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f677e97147123afba81270e156ac95223b9107402f738885f80b5d86351c15e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0005/storytimeline_400005417.json",
      "json_path": [
