    {
      "uid": "zhcn:623f1f0d96c8d625021acdd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因是大器晚成型而成长得非常缓慢的快乐米可，\n她的实力在迈入古马级后，终于开始开花结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5509a91f00a52b1da256e8ead9d803ed650d8a04e13edbdc2b61bba6d92c1a5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
