    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fc45cce5e14cca19e4981fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从出道开始就一直刻苦至今的\n快乐米可和桐生院训练员，\n像是为了挽回这段时光般努力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9bdc1b9fa1f0abfe0f1bb6df50bb3712268ba5916748fe4c2c34930c971cb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
