    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47595eddffe8e77baeca293f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是某天晚上，快乐米可倒下了，\n她被送到保健室，掀起了一阵骚动。\n其原因，是过度疲劳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0ec4f2d55904571c0e7271764a0f63c5f3ce224eba680a553a77df1917c6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0005/storytimeline_400005418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da3f7cd412e514e344efe4c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
