    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a05a9162e0795eb607db511e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "桐生院训练员对此感到非常沮丧，\n丧气地表示自己明明一直待在快乐米可身边，\n却没能好好守护她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6f80269ffe1b62df5797dd1ec3c753438adfa231ffe7b2d0761fef73eef1b0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
