      "uid": "zhcn:3dd4f0427794b46f661dafab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "苦涩糖衣向㭴本训练员坦白\n想靠自己的跑法获胜的心情。\n但㭴本没有轻易允诺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "165a1410bb3d5f4cccecbaa890f5f2da64ce9eda086db975ece00ee58c18aba5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
