      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这超出预料的表现，\n是小小蚕茧相信自己的武器，\n并相信㭴本的武器造就的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e29259ae19d5547a3f76da34d8cfa834c4a81ce0ba4895e66ec08bd0d69dadf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
