    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cdbf32cc67c82b6308d212e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，小小蚕茧表示希望她在面对苦涩糖衣时，\n也能相信自己的武器──相信自己的管理能力，\n而不是依靠知识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86dcc56fea9bf4acbb6b93f898c58fea9864d4795aef6ecbeba221fee19ca446",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0005/storytimeline_400005419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
